			<div class="content" id="post-content-2523661">
									

<p>This was some really creepy and odd stuff that is right up my alley. The photo seems a bit low-res, but I don't mind. You could excuse it as a video recording I guess. This was really interesting regardless.</p>
<p>And then&#8230; I get it, this would be up Oneiroi's alley, but the fact that this kind of thing appeared out of nowhere, with only a man in a suit looking worried about the concert, that gets my gears rolling. Oneiroi sticking their weird dream parasitic fingers in it seems odd when they sound like any other random group or person on this site. Oneiroi's involvement is tenuous at best, and feels a bit weird. Even if Oneiroi did cause this contrary to the letter, I think <a href="/scp-2272">SCP-2272</a> did this concept better.</p>

