<p>These are my thoughts exactly. When I saw that bright red text, I immediately thought &quot;<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qV0I-iA5lJU">THE 51ST STATE IS NOT A PLACE</a>,&quot; &quot;<a href="/scp-2316">You do not recognize the bodies in the water.</a>&quot;</p>
