<p>I'm another in this same boat. My thoughts throughout the early going went straight to 2316, and while on one level a repeat of that effect is a bit unnecessary, I actually thought this outdid the unrecognisable bodies in the water in some respects, by underplaying things to allow the tension to build.</p>
